{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10191","headline":"送评事十九叔入秦 · 李嘉佑","name":"送评事十九叔入秦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白露沾蕙草，王孙转忆归。\n蔡州新战罢，郢路去人稀。\n谒帝不辞远，怀亲空有违。\n孤舟看落叶，平楚逐斜晖。\n北阙见端冕，南台当绣衣。\n唯余播迁客，只伴鹧鸪飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}